<PB><a name=Kadish><font size=12 style=b><p align=center>Kadish's Testament<font size=10 style=n><p align=left>


Lerochay zuhoy. Mahnshootahvting mileshen zoo. Yim rahshahthon. Dohahrtenen gah dofolesen kheveelayoy b'koozah. Veechtahvteeon rifeeneet sahethoy.

Korvahkhtee keneet tomet roob ril bokoozah. Le'emee. Ken tomet te biv roo mairuh. Rilrovchahnshentoen tah me zoo. Bomahnshoo tomet te eest. To met kenen bahvahnin gah bojikahen bahvahnin.

Khoy hevtee met dohooreet pahl, rifoonemah roo ril kokino! Ril komahnshoo te rildil. Komahnshoo te bivdil. Fitayemah se tsosahtahvteeoy! Pishoeet b'zoo gah bokeneet t'zoo tsahn.

Shorah.

Tel nahvah Kaydish

<PB><font size=12 style=b><p align=center>Kadish's Testament<font size=10 style=n><p align=left>


I have reached my end. Death embraces me. I see its darkness. It is circling and waiting for my soul to surrender. Its screams torment my sleep.


There are linking books here but I will not surrender. I have won. I am here with everything that I own. No one can take it from me. I will die here with them. This place is hidden and will remain hidden.

If these words are ever found, remember that I did not fail! I did not die with nothing. I died with everything. Look at my possessions! They belong to me and will be with me forever.

Peace.

Guild Master Kadish

