<PB><a name=Serani><font size=12 style=b><p align=center>Appendix 3: Serani
<font size=10>(Myst IV Revelation Main Theme)<font style=n><p align=left>

Havahni devotah dom tormani ah
Azhwa nah Re-ve-la-ni ah

Revelani Mystana creatani ah tru salana (x2)
Comensaneen expedani, revelani erte yamana
Comensaneen expedani, Revelani mah!

<PB><font size=12 style=b><p align=center>Appendix 3: Serani
<font size=10>(Myst IV Revelation Main Theme)<font style=n><p align=left>

Your devotion and your torment
Will wash away Revelation

The Myst Revelation create a real world (x2)
We begin our adventure, it is our revelation
We begin our adventure, Revelation!
